infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Logging an error: flatten it vs keep the object
  desc Concatenation and JSON.stringify destroy the very fields that explain the failure
  compares
    - label Flatten it (lossy)
      children
        - label string-concat -> Error: message
          desc toString() drops the stack and the code
        - label JSON.stringify -> empty object
          desc message and stack are non-enumerable
        - label parse the message text
          desc prose, changes between Node versions
        - label cause chain is gone
          desc the root failure disappears
    - label Log the object (intact)
      children
        - label console.error(err)
          desc the full stack survives
        - label logger.error the object
          desc structured and machine-parseable
        - label branch on err.code
          desc ENOENT, ECONNREFUSED are stable API
        - label util.inspect prints cause
          desc from symptom down to root cause
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
